  "releaseNotes": "AstraFlow 1.8.3:\n      - Adds the AstraFlow.Generators package with deterministic generated mediator component registration.\n      - Generates readable DI registration code for request handlers, notification handlers, stream handlers, processors, and exception-flow components.\n      - Keeps runtime scanning as the fallback path while adding generator tests, docs, package verification, and compiler-asset checks.\n      - Full changelog: https://github.com/seifmoustafa/AstraFlow/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\n      - GitHub releases: https://github.com/seifmoustafa/AstraFlow/releases",
